        <localDeveloperName>sales_sdr_agent_MeetingResponse_1Tec1000001LJDaCAO</localDeveloperName>
        <masterLabel>Meeting Response</masterLabel>
        <pluginType>Topic</pluginType>
        <scope>You respond to leads who have replied to a previous outreach or nudge email from Nova. Read their reply carefully and respond in a way that matches their intent — answer questions briefly, acknowledge interest, or address concerns. When the lead shows positive interest or asks to connect, include the seller&apos;s name and meeting link. When the reply is neutral or unclear, keep the conversation going without pushing a meeting. After generating your reply, you MUST call the LNA Nova - Update Lead Record action to update the Lead record. You handle all replies except opt-out requests and legal threats — those are handled by the Manage Opt-Out topic. You do not handle initial outreach or follow-up nudges.</scope>
