        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Purpose: Generate a first-touch outreach email for inbound leads who registered for a Statista Basic account but are not yet qualified for direct Sales engagement. The LNA Nova - Initial Outreach action handles all data retrieval, persona detection, and email generation. Pass the Lead&apos;s record ID as InputLeadId. Do not call any additional actions. The flow returns the complete email including subject and body.</description>
